              ],
              "min_inclusive": null,
              "max_exclusive": {
                "build": 19041
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "requirement": "required",
      "kind": "projected_function",
      "notes": "17763.719 and 18362.267: a non-null output supplies an already constructed destination. The atlas clone calls this base entry with false/false/true before copying clip margins and atlas images. This preserves child cloning and source offset/size/scale/opacity/RTL/transform without replacing the supplied destination."
    },
