      ],
      "requirement": "required",
      "kind": "projected_function",
      "notes": "17763.719 EnsureNonClientAreaButton allocates 416 bytes through WPF::ProcessHeapImpl::Alloc, calls this constructor and then Initialize(IDwmChannel*). The constructor returns the constructed pointer; its last initialized member is the button glyph inset at +408. AvCreateProcessHeap caches GetProcessHeap; WPF allocation/free use HeapAlloc/HeapFree on that process heap. Preserve native deleting-destructor ownership."
    },
