      ],
      "requirement": "required",
      "kind": "projected_function",
      "notes": "17763.719 first initializes the atlas visual with the supplied channel, then creates and inserts both CAtlasButton instances. SetVisualStates owns bitmap-array references and RedrawVisual regenerates the glyphs."
